&lt;p data-start=&quot;4657&quot; data-end=&quot;4788&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4657&quot; data-end=&quot;4689&quot;&gt;Manufacturing &amp;amp; Supply Chain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4689&quot; data-end=&quot;4692&quot;&gt;• DFM/DFA reviews&lt;br data-start=&quot;4709&quot; data-end=&quot;4712&quot;&gt;• Tooling readiness&lt;br data-start=&quot;4731&quot; data-end=&quot;4734&quot;&gt;• Supplier qualification&lt;br data-start=&quot;4758&quot; data-end=&quot;4761&quot;&gt;• Clear to build planning&lt;/p&gt;
