&lt;p data-start=&quot;4896&quot; data-end=&quot;5057&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4896&quot; data-end=&quot;4924&quot;&gt;Hardware Systems Context&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;4924&quot; data-end=&quot;4927&quot;&gt;• Electromechanical systems&lt;br data-start=&quot;4954&quot; data-end=&quot;4957&quot;&gt;• Structural components&lt;br data-start=&quot;4980&quot; data-end=&quot;4983&quot;&gt;• Thermal and mechanical integration&lt;br data-start=&quot;5019&quot; data-end=&quot;5022&quot;&gt;• Prototype and production builds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5083&quot; data-end=&quot;5184&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;This role requires working on site 5 days per week. Hybrid and remote work options are not available.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pay Disclosure &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
