660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;security automation, and compliance tooling that enables the broader engineering org to move fast without compromising on security posture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;eep infrastr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;ucture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a security-first mindset and thrives in a regulated, high-accountability environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW167660934 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
