&lt;p&gt;As a BAYADA Direct Care Worker&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;you’ll have the opportunity to develop close relationships with your clients while you help them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
